#maps
# The vector tile data itself is hundreds of MB and regenerable from an OSM
# extract — never committed. config.json/styles/fonts are the small, stable
# part (a few MB) and ARE committed: they're the default bundle
# scripts/prepare-maps.sh seeds MAPS_DIR with, so only the .mbtiles needs to
# be transferred to a server by hand.
maps/iran-output.mbtiles
maps/*.mbtiles

